{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ludicrum</strong> is a no-limits sandbox game designed to give you total freedom to <i>\u201cplay god.\u201d</i> There are no goals, missions, or requirements \u2014just an experimental toybox and a few handy powers to help you achieve your desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/extras/5b4111a16ef59f1c9869adca8401019e.avif?t=1766705833\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>You can fight armies of robots with tanks, make a toilet the size of a skyscraper, create a flying bathtub, and literally anything else you can imagine. Ludicrum doesn't tell you what to do, it just gives you the tools to do what <strong><i>you</i></strong> want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/extras/de0b94435e1dfdddd6b61f71b1a022a2.avif?t=1766705833\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104910?t=1766705833","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/f7405aae0226e980ddae805be5f929857b6e391a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766705833","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/0df148fc54e7d07579e97ac1c6751d5d54f469c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766705833","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/0df148fc54e7d07579e97ac1c6751d5d54f469c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766705833","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ludicrum</strong> is a no-limits sandbox game designed to give you total freedom to <i>\u201cplay god.\u201d</i> There are no goals, missions, or requirements \u2014just an experimental toybox and a few handy powers to help you achieve your desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/extras/5b4111a16ef59f1c9869adca8401019e.avif?t=1766705833\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>You can fight armies of robots with tanks, make a toilet the size of a skyscraper, create a flying bathtub, and literally anything else you can imagine. Ludicrum doesn't tell you what to do, it just gives you the tools to do what <strong><i>you</i></strong> want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/extras/de0b94435e1dfdddd6b61f71b1a022a2.avif?t=1766705833\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Cheese Tart"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/10395efbdcbaca926a513de7db5eda5bc9c8d68b/header.jpg?t=1766705833","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104910/1005818587/c8dcdf0fd3745ab5c255514654939d2568ea81d0/1766705274/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766705832","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104910/1005818587/c8dcdf0fd3745ab5c25